* touch_dc

* SS34 Schottky (approx.: ~0.36 V at 0.8 A)
.model SS34 D(Is=5u N=1.05 Rs=0.04 Cjo=200p)
* 0603 LEDs: InGaN green (~2.6 V @ 1 mA) and AlInGaP yellow-green / yellow (~1.9 V @ 1 mA)
.model LED_GREEN_INGAN D(Is=1e-22 N=2.2 Rs=10)
.model LED_YG D(Is=1e-18 N=2.0 Rs=8)
* open-collector output stage of one LM339 unit: switch on when V(-) > V(+) + offset
.model OC SW(Vt=0 Vh=0.0001 Ron=40 Roff=1e9)


V1 3v3 0 3.3
Rsens 3v3 touch 1k
Rdiv touch 0 6.8k
Cf touch 0 100n
Rr1 3v3 vref 100k
Rr2 vref 0 10k
S_k k 0 vref cmp_k OC
V_os_k cmp_k touch 0.0

Rled 3v3 a 1k
Dled a k LED_YG

.control
set wr_singlescale
set wr_vecnames
dc Rsens 500 200k 250
wrdata /home/user/master-s-thesis/hardware/pcb/segment_board/sim/results/touch_dc.dat v(touch) v(vref) i(V1)
quit
.endc
.end
